  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>danielfeng</name>
    </author>
    <category term="本地 AI" scheme="https://danielfeng.github.io/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0-AI/"/>
    <category term="AI" scheme="https://danielfeng.github.io/tags/AI/"/>
    <category term="本地部署" scheme="https://danielfeng.github.io/tags/%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/"/>
    <category term="RAG" scheme="https://danielfeng.github.io/tags/RAG/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>家里一台普通服务器，没有独立显卡，也能跑一个会读书、会翻译、会回答问题的本地 AI。下面是我从零搭建的过程，以及踩过的坑和实测速度。</p><h2 id="一、我想要什么？"><a href="#一、我想要什么？" class="headerlink" title="一、我想要什么？"></a>一、我想要什么？</h2><p>我有不少电子书和 PDF。想要一个 AI，可以：</p><ul><li>读我的书：把 PDF、EPUB 放进去，以后直接提问</li><li>用中文回答：外文资料也能用中文提问</li><li>翻译、总结：外文译成中文，长文章收成几句话</li><li>完全私有：资料不上传到网上，也不用按月付费</li></ul><p>这种「先查资料，再回答」的方式，叫 RAG（检索增强生成）。</p><h2 id="二、我的硬件"><a href="#二、我的硬件" class="headerlink" title="二、我的硬件"></a>二、我的硬件</h2><table><thead><tr><th>部件</th><th>配置</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CPU</td><td>Intel i7-12700（8 个大核 + 4 个小核）</td></tr><tr><td>显卡</td><td>只有 CPU 自带的核显 UHD 770（没有独立显卡）</td></tr><tr><td>内存</td><td>128GB DDR4（4 × 32GB）</td></tr><tr><td>硬盘</td><td>2 块 1TB NVMe 固态硬盘</td></tr><tr><td>系统</td><td>Proxmox VE（PVE，一个虚拟机管理系统）</td></tr></tbody></table><p>重点：没有独立显卡。所以这篇文章讲的是只用 CPU 跑 AI。</p><h2 id="三、整体结构"><a href="#三、整体结构" class="headerlink" title="三、整体结构"></a>三、整体结构</h2><p><img                       lazyload                     src="/images/loading.svg"                     data-src="/images/posts/home-ai-rag/architecture.png"                      alt="整体结构"                ></p><p>这些服务全部放在 PVE 的一个 LXC 容器里，用 Docker Compose 一起管理。</p><table><thead><tr><th>组件</th><th>作用</th><th>为什么选它</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>llama.cpp</td><td>运行大模型</td><td>只用 CPU 也很快，支持 GGUF 格式</td></tr><tr><td>Qwen3.5-35B-A3B</td><td>大模型</td><td>中文好，多语言也不错；每个字只用 3B 参数，CPU 也跑得动</td></tr><tr><td>bge-m3</td><td>向量模型</td><td>支持很多语言，中文效果好</td></tr><tr><td>Qdrant</td><td>向量数据库</td><td>简单、稳定</td></tr><tr><td>Tika</td><td>读文件 + OCR</td><td>支持 PDF、EPUB、Word 等，可以识别中文扫描件</td></tr><tr><td>Open WebUI</td><td>网页界面</td><td>自带知识库功能，像 ChatGPT 一样好用</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="四、为什么选-A3B-这种模型？"><a href="#四、为什么选-A3B-这种模型？" class="headerlink" title="四、为什么选 A3B 这种模型？"></a>四、为什么选 A3B 这种模型？</h2><p>这是最重要的一点。</p><p>普通模型（比如 32B）：每写一个字，要用到全部 32B 参数。CPU 会非常慢。</p><p>MoE 模型（比如 35B-A3B）：模型虽然有 35B，但每写一个字只用 3B（A3B &#x3D; Active 3B）。</p><p>CPU 跑 AI 的速度，主要看内存每秒能读多少数据。每个字用到的参数越少，就越快。没有显卡的话，一定选 MoE 模型（名字里有 A3B、A2B 这种）。</p><h2 id="五、搭建步骤"><a href="#五、搭建步骤" class="headerlink" title="五、搭建步骤"></a>五、搭建步骤</h2><p>下面的容器编号写成 <code>&lt;CTID&gt;</code>，换成你自己的就行。</p><h3 id="第-1-步：创建-LXC-容器"><a href="#第-1-步：创建-LXC-容器" class="headerlink" title="第 1 步：创建 LXC 容器"></a>第 1 步：创建 LXC 容器</h3><p>在 PVE 主机上：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Bash"><figure class="iseeu highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 下载 Debian 12 模板</span></span><br><span class="line">pveam update</span><br><span class="line">pveam download <span class="built_in">local</span> debian-12-standard_12.12-1_amd64.tar.zst</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 创建容器：16 线程、72G 内存、200G 硬盘、开机自启</span></span><br><span class="line">pct create &lt;CTID&gt; <span class="built_in">local</span>:vztmpl/debian-12-standard_12.12-1_amd64.tar.zst \</span><br><span class="line">  --hostname ai-rag --unprivileged 1 --features nesting=1,keyctl=1 \</span><br><span class="line">  --cores 16 --memory 73728 --swap 4096 \</span><br><span class="line">  --rootfs local-lvm:200 \</span><br><span class="line">  --net0 name=eth0,bridge=vmbr0,ip=dhcp \</span><br><span class="line">  --onboot 1</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 只用大核（12700 的 CPU 0-15 是大核）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&quot;lxc.cgroup2.cpuset.cpus: 0-15&quot;</span> &gt;&gt; /etc/pve/lxc/&lt;CTID&gt;.conf</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p>内存怎么定？模型文件多大，就至少要多少内存，再多留 10–20G 给其他服务。</p><h3 id="第-2-步：在容器里安装-Docker"><a href="#第-2-步：在容器里安装-Docker" class="headerlink" title="第 2 步：在容器里安装 Docker"></a>第 2 步：在容器里安装 Docker</h3><div class="code-container" data-rel="Bash"><figure class="iseeu highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">pct enter &lt;CTID&gt;</span><br><span class="line">apt-get update &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y ca-certificates curl</span><br><span class="line">install -m 0755 -d /etc/apt/keyrings</span><br><span class="line">curl -fsSL https://download.docker.com/linux/debian/gpg -o /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&quot;deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc] https://download.docker.com/linux/debian bookworm stable&quot;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">  &gt; /etc/apt/sources.list.d/docker.list</span><br><span class="line">apt-get update &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-compose-plugin</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p><strong>坑 1：Docker 在 LXC 里跑不起来</strong></p><p>报错：<code>open sysctl net.ipv4.ip_unprivileged_port_start file: permission denied</code></p><p>原因：新版 Docker 和旧版 PVE（8.1）的 LXC 不兼容。</p><p>解决：在 PVE 主机的 <code>/etc/pve/lxc/&lt;CTID&gt;.conf</code> 里加两行，然后重启容器：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Plaintext"><figure class="iseeu highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">lxc.apparmor.profile: unconfined</span><br><span class="line">lxc.mount.entry: /dev/null sys/module/apparmor/parameters/enabled none bind 0 0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p>这样会降低这个容器的隔离性。升级到新版 PVE 以后，可以把这两行删掉。</p><h3 id="第-3-步：下载模型"><a href="#第-3-步：下载模型" class="headerlink" title="第 3 步：下载模型"></a>第 3 步：下载模型</h3><div class="code-container" data-rel="Bash"><figure class="iseeu highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">mkdir</span> -p /opt/ai-rag/models &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">cd</span> /opt/ai-rag/models</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 大模型（22GB）—— 国内推荐用魔搭社区，快很多</span></span><br><span class="line">wget -c https://modelscope.cn/models/unsloth/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-GGUF/resolve/master/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-Q4_K_M.gguf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 向量模型（0.6GB）</span></span><br><span class="line">wget -c https://hf-mirror.com/gpustack/bge-m3-GGUF/resolve/main/bge-m3-Q8_0.gguf</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p>下载小技巧：</p><ul><li>先看魔搭社区（ModelScope）有没有。我测试过，比 hf-mirror 快 20 倍。</li><li>用 <code>wget -c</code>，断了可以接着下载。</li><li>下载完核对一下 sha256，确认文件完整。</li></ul><h3 id="第-4-步：让-Tika-支持中文-OCR"><a href="#第-4-步：让-Tika-支持中文-OCR" class="headerlink" title="第 4 步：让 Tika 支持中文 OCR"></a>第 4 步：让 Tika 支持中文 OCR</h3><p>Tika 官方镜像的 OCR 没有中文语言包，自己加一下。</p><p><code>/opt/ai-rag/tika/Dockerfile</code>：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Dockerfile"><figure class="iseeu highlight dockerfile"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">FROM</span> apache/tika:<span class="number">3.2</span>.<span class="number">3.0</span>-full</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">USER</span> root</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">RUN</span><span class="language-bash"> apt-get update &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-bash">      tesseract-ocr-chi-sim tesseract-ocr-chi-tra \</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-bash">    &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">USER</span> <span class="number">35002</span>:<span class="number">35002</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p><code>/opt/ai-rag/tika/tika-config.xml</code>：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Xml"><figure class="iseeu highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;?xml version=<span class="string">&quot;1.0&quot;</span> encoding=<span class="string">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span>?&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">properties</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">parsers</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">parser</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;org.apache.tika.parser.DefaultParser&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">parser-exclude</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;org.apache.tika.parser.ocr.TesseractOCRParser&quot;</span>/&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">parser</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">parser</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;org.apache.tika.parser.ocr.TesseractOCRParser&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">params</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">param</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;language&quot;</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;string&quot;</span>&gt;</span>chi_sim+eng<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">param</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">param</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;preserveInterwordSpacing&quot;</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;bool&quot;</span>&gt;</span>true<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">param</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">params</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">parser</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">parsers</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">properties</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p><strong>坑 2：Tika 默认只认英文</strong></p><p>不改配置的话，中文扫描件识别出来是乱码。一定要设置 <code>language</code>。</p><p><strong>坑 3：不要用 Tika 4.x</strong></p><p>Tika 4.2 改了配置格式，文档很少，很难配。Open WebUI 也是按 Tika 3 设计的。用 3.2 版本最省事。</p><h3 id="第-5-步：Docker-Compose"><a href="#第-5-步：Docker-Compose" class="headerlink" title="第 5 步：Docker Compose"></a>第 5 步：Docker Compose</h3><p><code>/opt/ai-rag/.env</code>：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Bash"><figure class="iseeu highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">LLM_MODEL=Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-Q4_K_M.gguf</span><br><span class="line">LLM_ALIAS=qwen3.5-35b</span><br><span class="line">LLM_CTX=32768</span><br><span class="line">LLM_THREADS=8</span><br><span class="line">LLM_THREADS_BATCH=16</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p><code>/opt/ai-rag/docker-compose.yml</code>：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Yaml"><figure class="iseeu highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">ai-rag</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">services:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment"># 大模型（只用 CPU）</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">llm:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">ghcr.io/ggml-org/llama.cpp:server-b12407</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">container_name:</span> <span class="string">llm</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">./models:/models:ro</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">ports:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">&quot;8080:8080&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">command:</span> <span class="string">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      -m /models/$&#123;LLM_MODEL&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --alias $&#123;LLM_ALIAS&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      -c $&#123;LLM_CTX&#125; -np 1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      -t $&#123;LLM_THREADS&#125; -tb $&#123;LLM_THREADS_BATCH&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --reasoning-budget 0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --jinja --flash-attn on</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --cache-type-k q8_0 --cache-type-v q8_0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --temp 0.6 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20 --min-p 0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment"># 向量模型</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">embed:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">ghcr.io/ggml-org/llama.cpp:server-b12407</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">container_name:</span> <span class="string">embed</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">./models:/models:ro</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">command:</span> <span class="string">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      -m /models/bge-m3-Q8_0.gguf --alias bge-m3</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8081</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      --embedding --pooling cls</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      -c 8192 -b 8192 -ub 8192 -np 2 -t 4</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span>    <span class="attr">healthcheck:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">test:</span> [<span class="string">&quot;CMD&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;curl&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;-fs&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;http://localhost:8081/health&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">interval:</span> <span class="string">30s</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">qdrant:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">qdrant/qdrant:v1.20.1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">container_name:</span> <span class="string">qdrant</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">./data/qdrant:/qdrant/storage</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">tika:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">build:</span> <span class="string">./tika</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">local/tika-zh:latest</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">container_name:</span> <span class="string">tika</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">command:</span> [<span class="string">&quot;-c&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;/config/tika-config.xml&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">./tika/tika-config.xml:/config/tika-config.xml:ro</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">open-webui:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">ghcr.io/open-webui/open-webui:v0.13.3</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">container_name:</span> <span class="string">open-webui</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">depends_on:</span> [<span class="string">llm</span>, <span class="string">embed</span>, <span class="string">qdrant</span>, <span class="string">tika</span>]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">ports:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">&quot;3000:8080&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">./data/open-webui:/app/backend/data</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">environment:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">ENABLE_OLLAMA_API=false</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">OPENAI_API_BASE_URLS=http://llm:8080/v1</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">OPENAI_API_KEYS=none</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">VECTOR_DB=qdrant</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">QDRANT_URI=http://qdrant:6333</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">CONTENT_EXTRACTION_ENGINE=tika</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">TIKA_SERVER_URL=http://tika:9998</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RAG_EMBEDDING_ENGINE=openai</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RAG_OPENAI_API_BASE_URL=http://embed:8081/v1</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RAG_OPENAI_API_KEY=none</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RAG_EMBEDDING_MODEL=bge-m3</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">ENABLE_RAG_HYBRID_SEARCH=true</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RAG_RERANKING_MODEL=BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RAG_TOP_K=10</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RAG_TOP_K_RERANKER=5</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">CHUNK_SIZE=1000</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">CHUNK_OVERLAP=150</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">HF_ENDPOINT=https://hf-mirror.com</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p>镜像都钉了具体版本（这是 2026-11-15 写这篇文章时的版本），以后重建不会被自动更新改掉。</p><p>启动：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Bash"><figure class="iseeu highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> /opt/ai-rag</span><br><span class="line">docker compose up -d --build</span><br><span class="line">docker compose ps</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p>浏览器打开 <code>http://&lt;容器IP&gt;:3000</code>。第一个注册的账号就是管理员，记得马上注册。3000 和 8080 这两个端口都没有访问控制，只在家里的局域网用，不要直接暴露到公网。</p><h3 id="第-6-步：Open-WebUI-里一定要改的设置"><a href="#第-6-步：Open-WebUI-里一定要改的设置" class="headerlink" title="第 6 步：Open WebUI 里一定要改的设置"></a>第 6 步：Open WebUI 里一定要改的设置</h3><p><strong>坑 4：问一句话，AI 半天没反应</strong></p><p>新版 Open WebUI 会在每个问题后面，偷偷加上很多「内置工具」的说明（记忆、笔记、日历、代码解释器……），大约 3000–6000 个 token。你只问了 4 个字，AI 却要先读几千个 token。CPU 读这些要 1–2 分钟，看起来就像没反应。</p><p>解决（管理员面板 → 设置）：</p><ul><li>关掉用不到的功能：记忆、笔记、日历、自动化、代码解释器、网页搜索。</li><li>关掉后台任务：追问建议、自动标签、搜索查询生成。</li><li>模型设置里，把 Function Calling 改成 <code>Legacy</code>（这一步最重要）。</li></ul><h2 id="六、我踩过的其他坑"><a href="#六、我踩过的其他坑" class="headerlink" title="六、我踩过的其他坑"></a>六、我踩过的其他坑</h2><p><strong>坑 5：用核显加速，结果输出乱码</strong></p><p>我一开始用 llama.cpp 的 Vulkan 版本，让核显 UHD 770 帮忙算。</p><p>结果：输入一长段（几千字），AI 就开始输出乱码（「迎迎迎迎迎……」），而且以后一直坏着，要重启才好。</p><p>原因：Intel 核显 + Flash Attention 有 bug。</p><p>最后的结论更有意思：核显比 CPU 还慢。</p><table><thead><tr><th>方式</th><th>写字速度</th><th>读字速度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>核显（Vulkan 版）</td><td>8.6 个&#x2F;秒</td><td>51 个&#x2F;秒</td></tr><tr><td>只用 CPU（普通版）</td><td>11.3 个&#x2F;秒</td><td>58 个&#x2F;秒</td></tr></tbody></table><p>没有独立显卡，就直接用 CPU 版，不要折腾核显。</p><p><strong>坑 6：内存不够，AI 越来越慢</strong></p><p>Vulkan 版会把模型在内存里放两份（一份文件缓存，一份核显用）。容器内存满了以后，系统一直从硬盘重新读，速度很慢。</p><p>容器内存一定要比模型大很多。用 CPU 版的话，模型只放一份。</p><p><strong>坑 7：内存条没开 XMP</strong></p><p>我的内存条是 3200 的，但是 BIOS 默认只跑 2133。进 BIOS 打开 XMP（我的是华硕主板：Ai Tweaker → Ai Overclock Tuner → XMP I）。</p><p>CPU 跑 AI 主要靠内存速度，开了以后快了大约 30%。</p><p><strong>坑 8：建容器的时候，硬盘卡死了</strong></p><p>格式化 200G 硬盘的时候，三星 980（老固件）一直超时，整个系统都卡住了，最后只能硬重启。</p><p>如果你用三星 980：</p><ul><li>在 GRUB 里加：<code>nvme_core.default_ps_max_latency_us=0 pcie_aspm=off</code></li><li>把固件升级到最新版本。</li></ul><h2 id="七、三个模型的真实对比"><a href="#七、三个模型的真实对比" class="headerlink" title="七、三个模型的真实对比"></a>七、三个模型的真实对比</h2><p>同一台机器，只用 CPU，内存 3200：</p><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>写字速度</th><th>读同一段资料</th><th>文件大小</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Qwen3.5-35B-A3B</td><td>12.3 字&#x2F;秒</td><td>22 秒 ⭐</td><td>22G</td></tr><tr><td>Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507</td><td>15.2 字&#x2F;秒 ⭐</td><td>58 秒</td><td>18.6G</td></tr><tr><td>Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B</td><td>10.0 字&#x2F;秒</td><td>39 秒</td><td>48.5G</td></tr></tbody></table><p>三个模型的翻译和总结质量差不多。知识库每次都要先读很多资料，所以读得快最重要。我最后选了 Qwen3.5-35B-A3B。</p><h2 id="八、怎么用？"><a href="#八、怎么用？" class="headerlink" title="八、怎么用？"></a>八、怎么用？</h2><p><strong>建知识库</strong></p><ol><li>工作空间 → 知识库 → +，起个名字。</li><li>把 PDF、EPUB 拖进去（可以一次拖很多个，也可以上传整个文件夹）。</li><li>等它处理完。</li></ol><p><strong>提问</strong></p><ol><li>新建对话。</li><li>输入 <code>#</code>，选你的知识库。</li><li>用中文问问题。回答下面会显示用了哪些资料。</li></ol><p><strong>总结一个 PDF</strong></p><ol><li>对话里点 + 上传 PDF。</li><li>点文件，打开「使用完整文档」。</li><li>输入：<code>请用中文总结这个文件</code>。</li></ol><p><strong>给其他程序用</strong></p><p>模型地址是 OpenAI 格式，很多工具都可以直接用：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Plaintext"><figure class="iseeu highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">http://&lt;容器IP&gt;:8080/v1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><p>比如 pi agent（终端里的 AI 助手），配置 <code>~/.pi/agent/models.json</code>：</p><div class="code-container" data-rel="Json"><figure class="iseeu highlight json"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;providers&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">&quot;homelab&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">&quot;baseUrl&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;http://&lt;容器IP&gt;:8080/v1&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">&quot;api&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;openai-completions&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">&quot;apiKey&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;none&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">&quot;models&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span> <span class="attr">&quot;id&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;qwen3.5-35b&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span> <span class="attr">&quot;contextWindow&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">32768</span><span class="punctuation">,</span> <span class="attr">&quot;maxTokens&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">8192</span> <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="punctuation">]</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><h2 id="九、只用-CPU，到底能干什么？"><a href="#九、只用-CPU，到底能干什么？" class="headerlink" title="九、只用 CPU，到底能干什么？"></a>九、只用 CPU，到底能干什么？</h2><table><thead><tr><th>很适合</th><th>一般</th><th>做不了</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>查自己的资料（知识库）</td><td>大型编程项目</td><td>最新新闻（不能上网）</td></tr><tr><td>翻译、总结</td><td>很难的数学题</td><td>一次读完一整本书</td></tr><tr><td>学语言（当老师）</td><td>写邮件、改文章</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table><p>速度大概是：问一个知识库问题，等 20–40 秒开始回答，然后每秒写 10 个字左右。</p><h2 id="十、要不要买显卡？"><a href="#十、要不要买显卡？" class="headerlink" title="十、要不要买显卡？"></a>十、要不要买显卡？</h2><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>只用 CPU</th><th>加一张 16G 显卡</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>写字</td><td>约 12 字&#x2F;秒</td><td>约 30–50 字&#x2F;秒</td></tr><tr><td>知识库提问要等多久</td><td>20–40 秒</td><td>几秒</td></tr><tr><td>能做的事</td><td>一样</td><td>一样</td></tr></tbody></table><p>显卡主要是让 AI 变快，不是让 AI 变聪明。</p><p>我的建议：先用 CPU 版用几个星期。如果天天用、常常觉得慢，再买显卡（二手 RTX 3090 24G 性价比很高）。</p><h2 id="十一、总结"><a href="#十一、总结" class="headerlink" title="十一、总结"></a>十一、总结</h2><ul><li>没有显卡也可以跑本地 AI，关键是选 MoE 模型（A3B）。</li><li>内存速度很重要，记得开 XMP。</li><li>核显帮不上忙，直接用 CPU 版 llama.cpp。</li><li>Open WebUI 要关掉内置工具，否则会非常慢。</li><li>下载模型先找魔搭社区，国内快很多。</li></ul>]]>
    </content>
